---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const schema = [
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "AboutPage",
  "name": "About Word Hunt Solver",
  "url": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/about",
  "about": {
   "@id": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/#organization"
  },
  "inLanguage": "en-US"
 },
 {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 1,
    "name": "Home",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/"
   },
   {
    "@type": "ListItem",
    "position": 2,
    "name": "About",
    "item": "https://www.wordhuntsolvers.com/about"
   }
  ]
 }
];
---

<Layout
  title="About Word Hunt Solver"
  description="Who runs Word Hunt Solver, how we keep our Word Hunt facts accurate, and how to reach us. An independent site, not connected to GamePigeon."
  path="/about"
  schema={schema}
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 pb-12 pt-6 sm:pt-8">
    <header id="top" class="scroll-mt-24">
      <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-4 text-xs text-brand-400 dark:text-brand-300"><a href="/" class="hover:text-headline">Home</a> / <span aria-current="page">About</span></nav>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold leading-tight text-headline dark:text-headline-dark sm:text-4xl">About Word Hunt Solver</h1>
<p class="mt-3 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">This is a free website that helps GamePigeon Word Hunt players find every word on a board, see how to swipe it, and learn from the words they missed.</p>
    </header>
    <section id="what-youll-find-here" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">What You'll Find Here</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Our <a href="/" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">free solver</a> finds every word on a board you type in, from 3x3 up to 6x6, and shows the path for each one. Our <a href="/evolver" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Board Evolver</a> builds high scoring practice boards. <a href="/guides" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">Our guides</a> cover fair play, strategy, and how Word Hunt compares with other word tools.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="what-we-cover" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">What We Cover</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We focus only on GamePigeon Word Hunt. Every tool and guide here is built for that one game, so the advice fits the way Word Hunt actually plays and scores.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="our-standards-for-accuracy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4M12 8h.01"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Our Standards for Accuracy</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Facts on this site are checked against the sources listed on each page. Our solver uses the ENABLE word list, and we say so plainly. When a detail about the game hasn't been confirmed, like how points work for words longer than 8 letters, we leave it out instead of guessing.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="independent-from-gamepigeon" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Independent From GamePigeon</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">We're an independent site. We have no connection to GamePigeon or Apple, and we don't speak for either one.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="your-privacy" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Your Privacy</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">The solver runs in your browser, and the letters you type stay on your device. Read our <a href="/privacy-policy" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">privacy policy</a> for details. You don't need an account to use any tool on this site.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="contact-us" class="scroll-mt-24 py-6">
<div class="card">
<div class="mb-3 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="inline-flex h-10 w-10 flex-none items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-accent-500 text-brand-700 dark:bg-accent-600"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="h-5 w-5"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="16" rx="2"/><path d="m22 7-10 6L2 7"/></svg></span><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Contact Us</h2></div>
<p class="mt-2 text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">Found a bug or a wrong fact? Reach us through our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-headline underline-offset-2 hover:underline dark:text-headline-dark">contact page</a>.</p>
</div>
</section>
  </article>
</Layout>
